      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "api/client.ts + api/types.generated.ts — types are GENERATED from the\ncontracts by scripts/generate-api-types.mjs and drift-checked in CI.\nshell/navigation.ts, ErrorBoundary.tsx, PlaceholderScreen.tsx\nstate/asyncState.ts + AsyncBoundary.tsx — the five required view states.\nScreens are still PlaceholderScreen: the shell is real, the beats are not.",
      "originalText": "api/client.ts + api/types.generated.ts — types are GENERATED from the\ncontracts by scripts/generate-api-types.mjs and drift-checked in CI.\nshell/navigation.ts, ErrorBoundary.tsx, PlaceholderScreen.tsx\nstate/asyncState.ts + AsyncBoundary.tsx — the five required view states.\nScreens are still PlaceholderScreen: the shell is real, the beats are not.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
