      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Endpoints/ApprovalEndpoints.cs — propose · approve · reject · get.\nSecurity/ApprovalsAuthorization.cs — Proposer and Approver app roles,\ncaller identity read from the token oid claim, never from the body (ADR-011).\nPersistence/ApprovalStore.cs — IN-MEMORY today; Cosmos is T-014a.\nEvery refusal is audited too: \"someone tried to approve their own\nproposal and was stopped\" is the record an auditor comes looking for.",
      "originalText": "Endpoints/ApprovalEndpoints.cs — propose · approve · reject · get.\nSecurity/ApprovalsAuthorization.cs — Proposer and Approver app roles,\ncaller identity read from the token oid claim, never from the body (ADR-011).\nPersistence/ApprovalStore.cs — IN-MEMORY today; Cosmos is T-014a.\nEvery refusal is audited too: \"someone tried to approve their own\nproposal and was stopped\" is the record an auditor comes looking for.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
