      "versionNonce": 1018940730,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ApprovalStateMachine.cs · Approval.cs\nApprovalState / Command / Refusal\nEvidencePacket.cs · ExecutionGate.cs\nApprovalAuditEvent.cs\n\nNothing here can execute anything.\nThe strongest statement it can make\nis an ExecutionGate — an authorisation,\nnot a receipt. Whatever acts must\npresent one (ADR-008).",
      "originalText": "ApprovalStateMachine.cs · Approval.cs\nApprovalState / Command / Refusal\nEvidencePacket.cs · ExecutionGate.cs\nApprovalAuditEvent.cs\n\nNothing here can execute anything.\nThe strongest statement it can make\nis an ExecutionGate — an authorisation,\nnot a receipt. Whatever acts must\npresent one (ADR-008).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
