      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DemoDataGenerator.cs\nDemoUniverse.cs · DemoRecords.cs\nDeterministicRandom.cs\n\nSynthetic only, seeded, committed.\nThe generated volume is gitignored,\nso the repository carries the recipe\nrather than the data (Principle VI).\nNo real counterparty exists anywhere.",
      "originalText": "DemoDataGenerator.cs\nDemoUniverse.cs · DemoRecords.cs\nDeterministicRandom.cs\n\nSynthetic only, seeded, committed.\nThe generated volume is gitignored,\nso the repository carries the recipe\nrather than the data (Principle VI).\nNo real counterparty exists anywhere.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
